  tutorialName: Test Tutorial
  pages:
  - text: After a fight, you will automatically collect ingredients from monsters.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d76e9f30595c62640990cc629c412f68, type: 3}
  - text: Click on the "Bake" button to access the Pastry Crafting menu.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c5743ddaefc9db84095e7fe5f9641755, type: 3}
  - text: A list of the many pastries you can bake will appear. Click the desired
      Pastry and it will be ready for purchase in the Pastry Shop.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 61d14706b364edd42ab31fb92d02a9bd, type: 3}
